    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/fed7010ec675da2c56af6b8d96ffda07.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Follow the brave cat's adventures, making unexpected friends along the way \ud83d\udc23</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve increasingly tricky puzzles set in 4 different seasons \ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf1e\ud83c\udf42\u26c4 <strong></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/ad1b81e599db67a82d64a044767cfb50.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy chill tunes by independent musicians from around the globe \ud83c\udfb6 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cup of tea strongly recommended \ud83c\udf75 <strong></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/155c2f598dd00f9298f9d5a6541c0463.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip pieces horizontally or vertically, and repaint their colour \ud83c\udfa8</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/fdb1c8c778ab9df41eb7199b97f8cdb9.poster.avif?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=231 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/fdb1c8c778ab9df41eb7199b97f8cdb9.webm?t=1745761030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/d6e5fc9a115a646d2853e6cbbdb4821b.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always view the complete puzzle image as a reference \ud83d\udca1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you just wait a bit, and a piece in need of flipping will wiggle \u2728</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/1f3d6dca1cb1952abffce2532555ae25.poster.avif?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/1f3d6dca1cb1952abffce2532555ae25.webm?t=1745761030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/0fbfb7cfa668236a0833ecd2bf5ae4d0.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=15 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/fed7010ec675da2c56af6b8d96ffda07.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Follow the brave cat's adventures, making unexpected friends along the way \ud83d\udc23</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve increasingly tricky puzzles set in 4 different seasons \ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf1e\ud83c\udf42\u26c4 <strong></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/ad1b81e599db67a82d64a044767cfb50.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy chill tunes by independent musicians from around the globe \ud83c\udfb6 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cup of tea strongly recommended \ud83c\udf75 <strong></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/155c2f598dd00f9298f9d5a6541c0463.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip pieces horizontally or vertically, and repaint their colour \ud83c\udfa8</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/fdb1c8c778ab9df41eb7199b97f8cdb9.poster.avif?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=231 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/fdb1c8c778ab9df41eb7199b97f8cdb9.webm?t=1745761030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/d6e5fc9a115a646d2853e6cbbdb4821b.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always view the complete puzzle image as a reference \ud83d\udca1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you just wait a bit, and a piece in need of flipping will wiggle \u2728</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/1f3d6dca1cb1952abffce2532555ae25.poster.avif?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/1f3d6dca1cb1952abffce2532555ae25.webm?t=1745761030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785330/extras/0fbfb7cfa668236a0833ecd2bf5ae4d0.webp?t=1745761030\" width=600 height=15 /></span></p>",
